  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mr.Sakthivel vs The Commissioner on 5 December, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W. BEFORE THE MADURAI BENCH OF MADRAS HIGH COURT DATED: 05.12.2024 CORAM THE HONOURABLE MR. JUSTICE G.K.ILANTHIRAIYAN W.P (MD).No.9593 of 2019 and W.M.P(MD)Nos.10782 & 752 of 2019 Mr.Sakthivel ...Petitio Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drugs Administration, 359, Anna Salai, Chennai-6. 2.The Designated Officer, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drugs Administration, (Food Safety Wing), Namakkal Municipality 1 & 2, Namakkal, Namakkal District. 3.The Food Safety Officer, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drugs Administration (Food Safety Wing), Namakkal Municipality 1 & 2, Namakkal, Namakkal District. ...Respondents Prayer: Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution o issue a Writ of Certiorari, to call for the records pursuant to the impu notice of the second respondent vide proceedings https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/4 W.P Mr.Sakthivel vs The Commissioner on 5 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/2475733/ 1 2879/FSSA/2018/A2/2 dated 25.03.2019 and quash the same as illegal and against the Section and procedure under the Food Safety and Standards Ac 2006, Rules 2011. For Petitioner : Mr.S.Sarvagan Prabhu For R1 to R3 : Mr.D.Gandhi Raj Special Government Ple ORDER",
    "facts": "",
